+"""Workbook operations for the spreadsheet harness.
+
+Operations
+  inspect  exact occupied cells, formulas, comments, label indent and number format
+  write    apply caller-supplied values/formulas to a copy of a workbook
+  recalc   recompute through a real spreadsheet engine and report formula -> value
+  review   read-only arithmetic self-check of a delivery (never edits anything)
+  diff     compare a delivery with its source to show preserved-input changes
+"""
+
